       "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/loose.dtd\">\n<html><body><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://idx-acnt-ihouseprd.b-cdn.net/AR1140900/file_manager/Done_839.jpg?width=250&amp;height=250&amp;aspect_ratio=250%3A250\" style=\"float: left; width: 250px; height: 250px;\" srcset=\"https://idx-acnt-ihouseprd.b-cdn.net/AR1140900/file_manager/Done_839.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;aspect_ratio=250%3A250 2x\">&nbsp; &nbsp;Welcome to The Little Lady Sells Homes website!<br>\r\nYou have qualified to receive $1000&nbsp;off at closing in 2023 with either the purchase or the sale&nbsp;of your property at time of closing.</span><br>\r\n<br>\r\nFill out the form below or call Christine at 303-709-4262 and mention \"Client Appreciation\"</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><a href=\"/search-by-area\">BUYERS<br>\r\n\t\t\tAre you ready to start searching for your dream home?</a></p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><a href=\"/marketing-matters\">SELLERS<br>\r\n\t\t\tAre you ready to find out what your home is worth?</a></p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">I'm looking forward to partnering with you!</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p></body></html>\n"
